# Servers running seedex-agent that this router pulls its configs from.
# `sdx link add <router>` on the server prints the exact `sdx link add`
# command for the router; it creates a section like this one. The fingerprint
# pins the server's API certificate. Without `list config` every config the
# server offers is imported; `sdx link select` narrows it to the listed ones.
#
#   config link 'nl1'
#       option url         'https://203.0.113.5:8447'
#       option token       '...'
#       option fingerprint 'sha256//...'
#       list   config      'nl1-router'
#       list   config      'nl1-vless'
#
# Every 30 minutes (cron) and on demand with `sdx link sync` the router
# fetches the configs, replaces changed ones, adds new ones, drops the ones
# the server no longer has or that are no longer selected, and restarts the
# services that changed.
